    "$t": "豔遇"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">作者：施足珠</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">湖光山色草ōm-ōm　麗影雙雙</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">山幽幽　水茫茫　遊賞百花芳　</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">樹下阮一人　歇涼做眠夢</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">光頭白日　是啥人</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kā阮偷唚--一-喙　走去bih leh藏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">目睭peh金揣無人　kám是你</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">害阮面模仔烘烘　規面紅紅紅</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">一道烏影閃--過-去　liam-mi隨無--去</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">真正是你　kap阮走sio-bih</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">摸著喙phué　lóng mā你</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kā阮唚一下心肝lî-tsháng-tsháng</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">面癢癢　心ngiau-ngiau　愈挲面愈hàng</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">你ê輕聲細sueh　tńg-se̍h耳空邊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">聽kah阮規身軀起雞母皮hiù bē離</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">你ê雙手輕徙　遊挲皮肉</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Ngiau kah阮規身軀phi̍h-phi̍h-tshuah　bē輸牽電線</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kā你搧一下喙phué　</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我m̄是你ê tshit仔　mài來倚</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">你若有膽koh來　我ē獎勵你ê勇氣</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Hōo你一个pho̍k仔聲</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">蠓仔</span></p><div><br /></div><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span><b>做伙來唸詩</b></span><b><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</span></b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報328期，2021年7月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp